mportant Git commands
Command	Purpose
git branch branch_name-- create branch

git switch branch name -- switch to  branch if the vranch is exist

git branch -d branch name -- it will delete branch if branch is exist

to merge 2 separate branch


git merge branch_name -- merge it with main branch so ensure that before merge the branch is switched to main branch




git switch main	-- Switch to main branch

git switch -c branch name --	Create and switch 

git branch --	List branches

git push origin branch_name -- to push files on to a branch not directly main

git push origin main --	Push changes to main

git pull origin main	-- Get latest main branch changes

Remember:
- git switch main → Switch branch.
- git add → Stage changes.
- git commit → Save changes locally.
- git push origin main → Upload changes to GitHub's main branch.